#: ../../ml/map.rst:5
msgid "MAP推定と正則化最小二乗法"
msgstr "MAP Estimation and Regularized Least Squares"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:7
msgid ""
"MAP は *Maximum A Posteriori* の頭字語で、日本語では「最大事後確率」と呼ばれる。 "
"すなわちMAP推定は、実測データが得られた事後の確率分布を考える、\\ :ref:`ベイズの定理<bayes_theorem>`\\ "
"を応用した手法となる。"
msgstr ""
"MAP is an acronym for *maximum a posteriori*, that is, the maximum of the"
" posterior probability. MAP estimation uses \\ :ref:`Bayes' theorem "
"<bayes_theorem>`\\  to work with the posterior probability distribution "
"given the observed data."

#: ../../ml/map.rst:10
msgid "いま、回帰関数 :eq:`pgp1`"
msgstr "Consider the regression function in Equation :eq:`pgp1`."

#: ../../ml/map.rst:12
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top \\boldsymbol{\\phi}(\\boldsymbol{x})\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top \\boldsymbol{\\phi}(\\boldsymbol{x})\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"のパラメータ :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` に関して何らかの事前知識があり、それを確率分布の形で表せるという状況を考える。 "
"とりあえずの出発点として、\\ :ref:`ガウス分布<gaussian_dist>`\\ に従うとしておくのは一つの常套手段である "
"[#map1]_"
msgstr ""
"Suppose we have some prior knowledge about its parameters "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` and can express that knowledge as a probability "
"distribution. As a first step, a common choice is the \\ :ref:`Gaussian "
"distribution <gaussian_dist>`\\  below [#map1]_."

#: ../../ml/map.rst:21
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{N}(\\boldsymbol{w} | \\boldsymbol{0}, "
"\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2\\boldsymbol{I})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^M(\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2)^M}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}}{2\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2}\\right)}"
" .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{N}(\\boldsymbol{w} | \\boldsymbol{0}, "
"\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2\\boldsymbol{I})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^M(\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2)^M}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}}{2\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2}\\right)}"
" .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:30
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`\\ （と入力\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{X}`\\ "
"）が与えられたときに出力 :math:`\\boldsymbol{t}` を得る確率のモデル（\\ "
":ref:`尤度関数<likelihood_function>`\\ ）として、式 :eq:`ml3`"
msgstr ""
"Given \\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`\\  (and the inputs \\ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{X}`\\ ), we model the probability of obtaining the "
"outputs :math:`\\boldsymbol{t}` using the \\ :ref:`likelihood function "
"<likelihood_function>`\\  in Equation :eq:`ml3`."

#: ../../ml/map.rst:33
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"を採用する。このとき、 :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` の事後確率分布は\\ "
":ref:`ベイズの定理<bayes_theorem>`\\ より次のようになる"
msgstr ""
"With this model, \\ :ref:`Bayes' theorem <bayes_theorem>`\\  gives the "
"posterior distribution of :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` as follows."

#: ../../ml/map.rst:45
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{w} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{t})\n"
"= \\frac{\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"}{C} ,\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{w} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{t})\n"
"= \\frac{\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"}{C} ,\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"C\n"
"=\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X})\n"
"=\n"
"\\int p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})d\\boldsymbol{w} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"C\n"
"=\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X})\n"
"=\n"
"\\int p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})d\\boldsymbol{w} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:62
msgid "式 :eq:`map2` の対数をとる"
msgstr "Taking the logarithm of Equation :eq:`map2` gives"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:64
msgid ""
"\\ln{p(\\boldsymbol{w} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{t})}\n"
"=\n"
"- \\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - "
"y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}) )^2\n"
"- \\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2} "
"\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"- \\frac{(N+M)\\ln2\\pi}{2}\n"
"- \\frac{N\\ln\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}{2}\n"
"- \\frac{M\\ln\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2}{2}\n"
"- \\ln{C} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\ln{p(\\boldsymbol{w} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{t})}\n"
"=\n"
"- \\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - "
"y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}) )^2\n"
"- \\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2} "
"\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"- \\frac{(N+M)\\ln2\\pi}{2}\n"
"- \\frac{N\\ln\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}{2}\n"
"- \\frac{M\\ln\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2}{2}\n"
"- \\ln{C} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid "上式右辺を最大化するには、次式を :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` について最小化すればよい"
msgstr ""
"To maximize the right-hand side of the equation above, minimize the "
"following function with respect to :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`."

#: ../../ml/map.rst:77
msgid ""
"L(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - y(\\boldsymbol{x}_n,\\boldsymbol{w}) "
")^2\n"
"+ \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\lambda\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}{\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"L(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - y(\\boldsymbol{x}_n,\\boldsymbol{w}) "
")^2\n"
"+ \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\lambda\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}{\\sigma_\\boldsymbol{w}^2} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/map.rst:91
msgid ""
"これは、二次正則化項付きの最小二乗法（リッジ回帰）に他ならない。 また、式 :eq:`map4` に対しても、\\ "
":ref:`hyp_opt`\\ を実行することが可能である。"
msgstr ""
"This is precisely least squares with a quadratic regularization term "
"(ridge regression). For Equation :eq:`map4`, we can also carry out \\ "
":ref:`maximum likelihood estimation of the hyperparameters <hyp_opt>`\\ ."

#: ../../ml/map.rst:94
msgid "データ数 :math:`N` とパラメータ数 :math:`M` の違いに注意する。"
msgstr ""
"Note the distinction between the number of data points :math:`N` and the "
"number of parameters :math:`M`."

